An unarmored Dark Trooper that excels at ambushing and flanking it's targets, with small resistance to blasters.

^2Weaponry:
- Wrist Blade (Purple Saber)
-- Saber Defense (1)
-- Blaster Defense / Deflect (3)
-- Q3
-- 50% less damage

^5Powers:
